      "message": "Having looking closer at how your version of the macro works and what it looks like in situ, I prefer it over the existing coarser TINT macro (I also wasn\u0027t aware of the UNSAFE_BUFFER_BUILD macro, which I really like seeing removed).\n\nAs mentioned on the other review I agree with having a single pair of macros for the repo instead of a pair for tint and a pair for dawn",
