      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T15:11:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The plan is to remove the directory-level exclusions from:\n[unsafe_buffers_paths.txt](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/unsafe_buffers_paths.txt;l\u003d33-37?q\u003ddawn%2Funsafe_bu\u0026ss\u003dchromium)\nand replacing them with file-level exclusions (e.g. UNSAFE_BUFFER_BUILD macro)\n\nIn a second step, experiment with turning all of them into fine grained DAWN_UNSAFE_TODO: https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/305675\n... and idscuss with Dawn owners if we can apply it fully and/or partially depending on the amount of instances added.\n\nSee: https://go/unsafe-buffer-dawn",
